# Enabling All Broadcast Targeting Options

The goal is to enable all targeting options shown in the "Pro" design reference ("เพื่อนทั้งหมด", "จำกัดจำนวน", "Segment", "คนเดียว") which were previously disabled. This involves updating the database schema, UI, server actions, and the background worker.

## User Review Required
> [!WARNING]
> This requires a database migration to add new values to the `BroadcastTarget` enum. 
> `ALL_FRIENDS` targets everyone via LINE Broadcast API (bypassing DB). 
> `SEGMENT` will be implemented with basic "Active Users" logic for now.

## Proposed Changes

### Database Schema
#### [MODIFY] [schema.prisma](file:///d:/Workshop/line_oa/admin_panel/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Update `BroadcastTarget` enum:
    - Add `ALL_FRIENDS` (Broadcast API)
    - Add `LIMIT` (First N users)
    - Add `SEGMENT` (Logic-based groups)
    - Add `SINGLE` (Single user)

### UI Components
#### [MODIFY] [broadcast-form.tsx](file:///d:/Workshop/line_oa/admin_panel/src/components/broadcast/broadcast-form.tsx)
- Enable all [TargetOption](file:///d:/Workshop/line_oa/admin_panel/src/components/broadcast/broadcast-form.tsx#578-604) buttons.
- specific inputs for each new target type:
    - **LIMIT**: Input for number (e.g., 100).
    - **SEGMENT**: Dropdown for segments (e.g., "Active Users (7 days)", "New Users (30 days)").
    - **SINGLE**: Input for User ID.
    - **ALL_FRIENDS**: Info text explaining it uses LINE Broadcast API.
- Update validation logic.

### Server Actions
#### [MODIFY] [broadcast.actions.ts](file:///d:/Workshop/line_oa/admin_panel/src/actions/broadcast.actions.ts)
- Update [calculateRecipientCount](file:///d:/Workshop/line_oa/admin_panel/src/actions/broadcast.actions.ts#10-38):
    - `ALL_FRIENDS`: Return 0 or "Unknown" (since we don't know total followers without Insight API, might just say "All Followers").
    - `LIMIT`: Return the limit number.
    - `SEGMENT`: Query count based on segment logic.
    - `SINGLE`: Return 1.
- Update [sendBroadcast](file:///d:/Workshop/line_oa/admin_panel/src/actions/broadcast.actions.ts#39-97):
    - Handle new types and pass config to [Broadcast](file:///d:/Workshop/line_oa/admin_panel/src/actions/broadcast.actions.ts#120-136) creation.

### Background Worker
#### [MODIFY] [run.ts](file:///d:/Workshop/line_oa/admin_panel/src/workers/run.ts)
- Update `processBroadcast`:
    - `ALL_FRIENDS`: Use `client.broadcast(messages)`.
    - `LIMIT`: Fetch `take: n` customers.
    - `SEGMENT`: logic for filtering (e.g. `updatedAt` > 7 days ago).
    - `SINGLE`: Send to 1 ID.

## Verification Plan
### Automated Tests
- Build verification.

### Manual Verification
- Test creating broadcasts with each new target type.
- Verify "Recipient Count" updates correctly for each.
- Verify behavior in [run.ts](file:///d:/Workshop/line_oa/admin_panel/src/workers/run.ts) by logging (or running actual broadcast if safe/test env).
